#: konfigurator.cpp:102
msgid "New Wallet"
msgstr "Novi novčanik"

#: konfigurator.cpp:103
msgid "Please choose a name for the new wallet:"
msgstr "Odaberite ime za novi novčanik, molim:"

#: konfigurator.cpp:194
msgid "Always Allow"
msgstr "Uvijek: Dopušten"

#: konfigurator.cpp:260
msgid "This configuration module allows you to configure the KDE wallet system."
msgstr "Ovaj konfiguracijski modul dopušta van da konfigurišete KDE sistem novčanika."

#: konfigurator.cpp:266
msgid "kcmkwallet"
msgstr "kcmkwallet"

#: konfigurator.cpp:267
msgid "KDE Wallet Control Module"
msgstr "KDE kontrolni mogul novčanika"

#: konfigurator.cpp:269
msgid "(c) 2003 George Staikos"
msgstr "(c) 2003 George Staikos"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Wallet Preferences"
msgstr "Prednosti novčanika"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Enable the KDE wallet subsystem"
msgstr "&Omogući KDE podsistem novčanika"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>The wallet subsytem allows a convenient and secure way to manage all your "
"passwords. You can decide if you want to use this system with this option.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Podsistem nočanika dopušta pouzdan i siguran način da upravljate vašim šiframa. Možete odlučiti želite li koristiti "
"ovaj sistem sa ovom opcijom</p>"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "Close Wallet"
msgstr "Zatvori novčanik"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid ""
"It is wise to close your wallets when you don't use them anymore so not "
"everyone can look in them or use them."
msgstr "Mudro je da zatvorite svoje novčanike kad ih više ne koristite tako da ih niko ne može gledati i koristiti."

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Close when unused for:"
msgstr "Zatvori kad nije korišten za:"

#: rc.cpp:7 rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"<p><b>Close wallet after a period of inactivity</b><br>When a wallet is "
"closed the password is needed to access it again.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Zatvori novčanik nakon neaktivnosti</b><br>Kad je novčanik zatvoren potrebna je šifra da mu se ponovo "
"pristupi.</p>"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid " min"
msgstr " min"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Close when screensaver starts"
msgstr "Zatvori kad se pokrene screensaver"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"<p><b>Close wallet as soon as the screensaver starts.</b><br>When a wallet "
"is closed the password is needed to access it again.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Zatvori novčanik kad se pokrene screensaver.</b><br>Kad je novčanik zatvoren potrebna je šifra da mu se ponovo "
"pristupi.</p>"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Close when last application stops using it"
msgstr "Zatvori kad ga zadnja aplikacija prestane koristiti"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid ""
"<p><b>Close wallet as soon as applications that use it have stopped.</"
"b><br>Note that your wallets will only be closed when all applications that "
"use it have stopped.<br>When a wallet is closed the password is needed to "
"access it again.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Zatvori novčanik čim je aplikacija koja ga koristi zaustavljena. </b>"
"<br>Primjetite da će vaši novčanici biti zatvoreni samo kada "
"sve aplikacije koje ga koriste budu zaustavljene.<br>Kad je novčanik zatvoren potrebna je šifra "
"da mu se ponovo pristupi.</p>"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Automatic Wallet Selection"
msgstr "Automatski izbor novčanika"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Select wallet to use as default:"
msgstr "Izaberi novčanik koji će se koristiti automatski:"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Different wallet for local passwords:"
msgstr "Različit novčanik za lokalne šifre:"

#: rc.cpp:17 rc.cpp:18
msgid "New..."
msgstr "Novi..."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Wallet Manager"
msgstr "Upravljanje novčanikom"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Show manager in system tray"
msgstr "Pokaži menadžera pored sata"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Hide system tray icon when last wallet closes"
msgstr "Skloni ikonu pored sata kad je zadnji novčanik zatvoren"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Access Control"
msgstr "Kontrola pristupa"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "&Prompt when an application accesses an open wallet"
msgstr "&Upitaj kad aplikacija pristupi otvorenom novčaniku"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Wallet"
msgstr "Novčanik"

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Aplikacija"

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Smijer"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "&Launch Wallet Manager"
msgstr "&Pokreni menadžer novčanika"

